WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:09.040
RIght now we're standing in line for the Blumhouse attraction here at Halloween Horror Nights.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.740
Last year we did The Purge maze which was fun,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.320
but this year they've added the entire Blumhouse lineup, so we've got:

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.360
a new contender in Happy Death Day,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.120
Sinister,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.680
Insidious I think is a different maze,

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.900
and all of the Blumhouse properties mixed into one.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.620
It's a mixtape. It's very high quality music.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:29.460
I'm giving them out, but only a couple people will get the limited edition Claude Gnome edition.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.760
Who are you going to be giving them out to?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.000
The Purge people.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.060
Search Claude Gnome on YouTube.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.120
And then your life will be good.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.400
You guys get to go first.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:02:00.880
Ashes, ashes, we all fall down...

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.320
Ring around the rosie...

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.920
Pocket full of poseys.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:17.480
Ashes. Ashes.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:20.440
We all fall down.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:30.420
This is my boyfriend.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.020
You want it?

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.480
Subscribe to Claude Gnome.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.920
That's the real one!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.000
Mixtape?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.120
Oh, he actually took it!

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.260
He actually!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.340
He took his mixtape.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.660
We did the Blumhouse thing.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:29.440
It really wasn't all the Blumhouse movies, but it was just those three that I listed.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.680
Happy Death Day, The Purge and Sinister.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.300
The best one was probably The Purge section.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.360
The Happy Death Day one was a little bit disappointing.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.640
I handed it to him. He saw how good the artwork was on it.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.640
And he said, "this looks like high quality music,"

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.500
so he took it.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.640
Did you say anything to him?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.900
I said bruh, checkout my mixtape!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:07.880
We did the Blumhouse one, now we're in line for just the Insidious one.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:11.460
So I'm here, there are a lot of horror fans here, I'm assuming at Halloween Horror Nights.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.880
So I figure, might as well do some marketing while I'm here.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.180
OK, I couldn't get it to stick to that pole,

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.300
But them some people saw me trying to do it and asked me what I was doing,

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.500
so then I handed out a bunch of them.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.880
So I think I'm doing good in the marketing department right now.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.180
Ayyyyyy!!!!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.300
Never do that again.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:35.160
I really liked the Purge, but the Happy Death Day was really disappointing.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:39.240
Basically all they did was have the baby mask everywhere and they didn't really do anything with the movie.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.320
What was your favorite part of the Blumhouse maze?

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.860
When they took my mixtape.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.040
That's my favorite guy.

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.020
He sees you.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.800
Don't you dare!!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.120
This entity is very powerful.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.840
The elevator's gonna take a while.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.360
OMG it's real.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.420
Held with the tortured soul.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.720
DON'T YOU DARE!!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.700
No one wanted my mixtape.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.280
So we did the Insidious one.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.560
It was shorter than the Blumhouse one.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:37.140
And my favorite guy was only in it once, but what they did have was pretty cool.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:40.980
The last 3 seconds when that guy almost hit me in the face, that was pretty scary.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.400
Oh, when she walked up and screamed in my face?

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:46.820
That was really terrifying, it was like flashbacks of my mother.

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:01.460
They didn't take my mixtape.

